  "question": {
    "text": "Let a random variable <math><mi>X</mi></math> has a binomial distribution with mean <math><mn>8</mn></math> and variance 4. If <math><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>X</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>16</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo></math> then the value of&nbsp;<math><mi>k</mi></math> is equal to",
